SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The rreeaadd() system call is expected to conform to ISO/IEC 9945-1:1990
     (“POSIX.1”).  The rreeaaddvv() and pprreeaadd() system calls are expected to con‐
     form to X/Open Portability Guide Issue 4, Version 2 (“XPG4.2”).

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The pprreeaaddvv() system call appeared in FreeBSD 6.0.  The pprreeaadd() function
     appeared in AT&T System V Release 4 UNIX.  The rreeaaddvv() system call ap‐
     peared in 4.2BSD.  The rreeaadd() function appeared in Version 1 AT&T UNIX.

